{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01883",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.1,
      "end_seconds": 5.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Mm, sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.08,
      "end_seconds": 11.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.11,
      "end_seconds": 16.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm here because of itchy raised welts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.39,
      "end_seconds": 21.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.71,
      "end_seconds": 26.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Cetirizine, 10 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.04,
      "end_seconds": 31.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.06,
      "end_seconds": 35.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "it's been like this since this morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.9,
      "end_seconds": 38.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.84,
      "end_seconds": 41.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "It happens on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.7,
      "end_seconds": 45.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "So, what eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.15,
      "end_seconds": 49.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Only antihistamine, and and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 53.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "okay, go on how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.31,
      "end_seconds": 57.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "I, I'd say severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.15,
      "end_seconds": 60.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "What brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.54,
      "end_seconds": 63.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "It's worse with heat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.57,
      "end_seconds": 68.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Did you get throat tightness, fever or difficulty breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.53,
      "end_seconds": 78.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "So, um, no throat tightness, fever or difficulty breathing, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.03,
      "end_seconds": 83.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Right, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.52,
      "end_seconds": 90.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Nothing there, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.24,
      "end_seconds": 93.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.83,
      "end_seconds": 97.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.03,
      "end_seconds": 102.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.0,
      "end_seconds": 105.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Erythromycin, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.98,
      "end_seconds": 117.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.19,
      "end_seconds": 121.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.15,
      "end_seconds": 131.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.02,
      "end_seconds": 137.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.18,
      "end_seconds": 143.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "yes, carry on do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.91,
      "end_seconds": 147.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.24,
      "end_seconds": 151.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "alright, have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.41,
      "end_seconds": 157.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.69,
      "end_seconds": 161.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.25,
      "end_seconds": 167.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.01,
      "end_seconds": 180.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.69,
      "end_seconds": 190.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.92,
      "end_seconds": 210.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 71, temp 36.8 degrees, saturation 97 percent. And BP is 118 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.09,
      "end_seconds": 217.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.94,
      "end_seconds": 222.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.56,
      "end_seconds": 246.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "There are pink raised wheals on the arms and trunk that blanch with pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.32,
      "end_seconds": 250.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "alright, you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.3,
      "end_seconds": 271.19,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking this is probably chronic spontaneous urticaria. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for chronic urticaria"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.99,
      "end_seconds": 276.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.59,
      "end_seconds": 291.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Let's use fexofenadine, 180 milligrams, once a day, long term. It's for urticaria. Keep a diary of foods and triggers and avoid hot showers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.2,
      "end_seconds": 297.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "understood how would you describe the plan, so we're on the the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.59,
      "end_seconds": 306.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "So, I take the fexofenadine, 180 milligrams, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.57,
      "end_seconds": 313.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.18,
      "end_seconds": 317.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.96,
      "end_seconds": 320.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
}